 "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75312297_643955654606405_480568527955268312_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=lHi2mPkhfuQQ7kNvwGl7lfH&_nc_oc=Adq5vmJM_mLYBTp5aMJbNdkrnDiGbxgQcf54ONJ8cOqjNYY8npUKfaFD20D0Q6hw47Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGHr7CJZTbFNWX2kPmQRmzlIrUPQkVvUmKD4x79QJWC9g&oe=6A858EA6"}, {"file_name": "Master.00_00_34_53.Still005.png", "id": "868776144968854", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57574721_868776148302187_2395318248093284663_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qVn92GfvH8kQ7kNvwEuXh0I&_nc_oc=AdoJAVXU3ocxHvF7qA4FwaPLBxxwhKpVAvp1RelEHPZMq4A8KHoiF5-_W5fyf2AbAeE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFimJ5cIE9vGKxd253Cbk4v-fye3IG1hoTLRHNNWotEaw&oe=6A8583F2"}, {"file_name": "Master.00_00_25_53.Still002.png", "id": "692760662818107", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982461_692760666151440_1673600769700015261_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=QGL_I40DGtIQ7kNvwG0EfaO&_nc_oc=Adpg8DA19aqq_7WDDIrU0cV2ofZl2yRIM_G-6RaHeXHj5FxOfoJVlNrXbhj9XzXqQPw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQEtuAnOu_Jme-y7_eEQHtWR8OqFFK3ltWWvwiKw9ZrcjQ&oe=6A857DBB"}, {"file_name": "2023-07-01 19-38-56.mp4.00_05_33_04.Still001.png", "id": "1014728119759484", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974571_1014728126426150_3738956639406327634_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=HbkJ-vgsPikQ7kNvwFOSo7P&_nc_oc=Adp1gnJUxh83dC-KRUNfszCk348y0ZiFtG20KtkmyCSlN36DLzJi8-A2IpvPh3pHVy8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFGnd_-r__AlJ5Ht7aksJQGNlqE8Ozf3xun31-C3j32ww&oe=6A859333"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Trailer_End_Card-Recovered.png", "id": "273391962004750", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974788_273391965338083_1886064065722113930_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kTTD4b8hDkwQ7kNvwFTPkDC&_nc_oc=Ado69_a6Lz3aT_h8EEmw2OHXDyW1BL5A5CfGmwFBkj7Bh0UyV-JxPkt2S4SP_ZJSPGE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHLFWwb3nz_ZQONBKImQ_MeeM1Q4Lvf3FuqocP1rQk2fw&oe=6A859132"}, "display_name": "Ziggy's Cosmic Adventures", "keywords": ["Cockpit", "Alien", "Green", "Space", "Physics"], "long_description": "Ziggy's Cosmic Adventures is a VR cockpit game combining ship management with action-arcade combat. You play as a (sometimes effective) bounty hunter with possibly questionable morals, currently in possession of a powerful little alien that you may or may not have stolen/liberated from the evil Empire. As the Empire closes in, you'll need to find a way to balance your ship's management with the onslaught of attacks. Do you have what it takes to survive?\n\n\u2022 Become one with the ship: Immerse yourself in a cockpit packed full from ceiling to floor with distinct physics-based interactions (Though make sure to keep your eye on them all if you want to survive!).\n\n\u2022 Rebel against The Empire: Engage in thrilling dogfights as squads of enemies pursue you to re-capture the small green treasure aboard your ship - shoot bullets, launch bombs, and raise your shields. It's going to get bumpy!\n\n\u2022 Navigate the vacuum of space: Control the ship with a radical and easy-to-use virtual flight stick design, dodge your way through hazardous space environments, and don't forget to do a barrel roll!\n\n\u2022 The little guy: Who could forget your cosmic friend, Ziggy?! This mysterious creature is a perfect fuel source. You can also play with them, use them as a resource, feed them, and most importantly pet them!\n\n\u2022 The Journey: Fight your way through 13 unique levels total. Forge a different path each time by beating challenges and unlocking harder worlds en route.", "short_description": "Ziggy's Cosmic Adventures is a VR cockpit game combining ship management with action-arcade combat. You play as a (sometimes effective) bounty hunter with possibly questionable morals, currently in possession of a powerful little alien that you may or may not have stolen/liberated from the evil Empire. As the Empire closes in, you'll need to find a way to balance your ship's management with the onslaught of attacks. Do you have what it takes to survive?"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "Ziggy_Monoscopic.png", "id": "1296582511245835", "image_type": "APP_IMG_CUBEMAP_SOURCE", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974446_1296582517912501_8438674573824683709_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=T7xXMsHaXukQ7kNvwHFjQ59&_nc_oc=AdrUzggIvmuVJHwKkDzROa2EVMdIGPP4RkN_kqQ4RfoKb3TP4barJybztDF5hnHqEos&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQGNUR3_fbiHFt_i9icTuOLXgVgmhItLpgD-ZnM6njcb3g&oe=6A858893"}, {"file_name": "CoverSquare.png", "id": "1124369782419830", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39036658_1124369785753163_6062844584904789074_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=K4TNZF63JEkQ7kNvwELkG5W&_nc_oc=Adro0nwL7lcAi-Jt80aFhrG-hBVmHaYrBQqXsgfydB70Az9hNWj4uJoUq_3h7Kslsi4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFVCOeLqtSJ0Oifnb3CzGuX_E5J0htkjtbTdvTquNt4vA&oe=6A8584AF"}, {"file_name": "Icon_v1.png", "id": "1106448921139578", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001696_1106448927806244_1890053882317213161_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=4i9cOzLWg-4Q7kNvwFATGbm&_nc_oc=AdoyZh-IebjHeEX20FBGp6ojFPluRrD8gy5v28LyDl0jjGIOUqR9OWQU2cJuavFezBc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQFchDQXa2fNSvwzRc4GQBNqsu-F1guR3QoHo4a9ksgr0Q&oe=6A859062"}, {"file_name": "Logo.png", "id": "973425620588096", "image_type": "APP_IMG_LOGO_TRANSPARENT", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/86610716_97